WEBVTT

00:00:00.752 --> 00:00:07.882
The Upcoming tab is the first thing you see when you open the app: the next events of Formando Congo, each with a countdown.

00:00:08.383 --> 00:00:12.783
Tap an event to open it. You see the dates, the place and the full programme.

00:00:13.284 --> 00:00:20.124
Starting five days before an event, you also see the weather forecast for that city: the temperature and the chance of rain.

00:00:20.626 --> 00:00:27.706
Descriptions written in another language are translated into yours automatically. Tap the orange note to see the original text.

00:00:28.206 --> 00:00:36.146
If the organisers put a flyer or an Instagram post in the description, you see it right here. Tap a picture to open it full size.

00:00:36.647 --> 00:00:41.807
Use the buttons at the bottom to add the event to your own calendar, or to open the place in Maps.

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:50.288
Going? Tap I'm going. The organisers then see your name in their list. Plans changed? Tap again to undo.

00:00:50.789 --> 00:01:01.969
When an organiser drives, you see the car, the free seats, and where and when it leaves. Tap Reserve a seat. It's first come, first served, and you can always give your seat back.

00:01:02.470 --> 00:01:06.930
Back in the list, the events you're going to stand out in orange, so you never miss one.

